:: Widgets DoLX Changelog [widget]
<<widget "DoLXChangelog">>
	<div class="dolx-changelog">
		<div class="dolx-changelog-hero">
			<span class="dolx-changelog-hero-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#128220;</span>
			<div>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-label">PATCH NOTES</div>
				<h1>DoL X-Change <span>v0.20.18</span></h1>
				<div class="dolx-changelog-apk-note"><strong>Official X-Change APK:</strong> Join the DoL Modding server and check the dedicated <a href="https://discord.com/channels/675158131688603721/1512272787572785162" target="_blank">X-Change Channel</a>.</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<a class="dolx-changelog-release-link" href="https://gitgud.io/Akoz/dol-xchange/-/releases" target="_blank"><span aria-hidden="true">&#128279;</span> View the full changelog and all releases <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon new" aria-hidden="true">&#10022;</span> Changes and Additions</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Merged Reiyu's RBE v0.6.0</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Merged, audited, and bug-fixed by D.N.A.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Reworked Autism Spectrum trait</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Replaced the old Gifted/Burnout cycle with capacity, load, recovery, and meltdown mechanics.</li>
		<li>Fixations now last 3–5 days and help recovery without being the only recovery method.</li>
		<li>Added Harper consultation, documentation, weekly appointments, and new Kylar interactions.</li>
		<li>Existing saves are converted automatically.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded the hospital pharmacy</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added over-the-counter sleeping pills and anti-anxiety tablets.</li>
		<li>Harper can prescribe stronger sleeping pills, painkillers, and antidepressants for free (if your condition worse).</li>
		<li>Prescriptions provide 10 doses, expire after one week, and include overdose handling.</li>
		<li>Daily pill use now supports Harper prescriptions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded Gender Identity</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added makeup/bare-face preferences and related dysphoria.</li>
		<li>Added makeup interactions during non-consensual encounters.</li>
		<li>Added audience dysphoria based on how groups perceive your gender.</li>
		<li>Added a mirror meter showing your exact Masculine, Androgynous, or Feminine presentation score.</li>
		<li>Added an option to clear preferred penis size without disabling genital preferences.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added X-Change monster-person combat pill setting</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Monster people can carry combat pills independently of ordinary beasts.</li>
		<li>Mixed encounters now check pill access per enemy.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added Gentleman's Club reward scaling</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added a Rebalance slider for blackmail quest rewards.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added new minimaps</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added maps for Serpent's Maze, Landfill, and the tentacle hookah parlour.</li>
		<li>Unlocking all minimaps now requires History grade A.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Expanded Avery's mansion</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added a private bar and gym, unlocked after Avery's later progression.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added dance studio storage</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Charlie's changing room now has a locker for storing clothes and shoes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added new body-size feats</strong>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Chiwawa Ferocity:</strong> miniature, maximum physique and defiance.</li>
		<li><strong>Is That a Doll?:</strong> miniature, maximum beauty and submission.</li>
		<li><strong>Mountain Mover:</strong> giant, maximum physique and defiance.</li>
		<li><strong>Gentle Giant:</strong> giant, maximum beauty and submission.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added more fetish settings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Added separate options for preventing Micro/Mini penis semen-volume loss and allowing female-style orgasms at any penis size.</li>
		<li>Bull and Alpha pills now each add 1,500 mL maximum semen volume, up to the 14,000 mL cap.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Added arousal audio controls</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Arousal moans outside combat can now be lowered or muted.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Tweaks and Rebalancing</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Updated Whitney</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Transfem PCs can progress from panties to Whitney's skirt rule without requiring a small penis or chastity cage.</li>
		<li>Updated Whitney's dom icon.</li>
		<li>Fixed Whitney teleporting from the gym to the park.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Avery</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Pill decisions now use gender presentation, falling back to body sex when androgynous.</li>
		<li>Corrected mansion pill chances, spare Choice pill handling, pill reminders, and gender-identity responses.</li>
		<li>Fixed the second street meeting incorrectly using the park statue ending.</li>
		<li>Avery only reacts angrily to actually using <strong>Give Up</strong>, rather than normal encounter endings.</li>
		<li>Fixed Avery bathing while fully dressed.</li>
		<li>Fixed consensual sex incorrectly using the <code>&lt;&lt;tearfull&gt;&gt;</code> macro.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Robin</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Crossdressing outfits now use Robin's original sex while a genderflip pill is active.</li>
		<li>Fixed related Canteen, Gwylan beach, and orphanage outfit checks.</li>
		<li>Halloween text now follows Robin's current gender.</li>
		<li>Expanded Robin's responses to the player's gender identity, including nonbinary follow-up dialogue and pill discussions.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Gwylan</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed narration in the Strong Wings quest.</li>
		<li>Updated hypnosis and English-play text.</li>
		<li>X-Change pills can now be given during an encounter.</li>
		<li>Improved forest-shop hiding and unseen-target narration.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated childbirth and Water Dragon content</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed Alex childbirth dialogue crashes and synchronised labour conditions, triggers, and stat checks.</li>
		<li>Repaired missing labour countdowns in affected saves.</li>
		<li>Legacy vaginal and anal pregnancies can now be delivered safely one at a time.</li>
		<li>Added safe restrained-birth fallback text for Water Dragon pregnancies.</li>
		<li>Tidied Water Dragon egg-laying scenes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated chastity</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>X-Change reshaped cages and belts now use their current form for gender, ejaculation, clothing, and display checks.</li>
		<li>Temple refusals now use public reputation instead of private preferences.</li>
		<li>Police refusals only apply while actively wanted.</li>
		<li>Forced chastity no longer causes frustration for Pure, Angelic, or Innocent characters.</li>
		<li>Fixed refusal sequences trapping or leaving the player undressed.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Bimbo and Dumb Bitch</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Both now provide 90% Stress resistance, matching Satisfied Breeder.</li>
		<li>Fixed Bimbo cleanup and promiscuity-state leaks.</li>
		<li>Bimbo now reliably applies its Swell changes, including on older saves.</li>
		<li>Swell and other pill effects now end cleanly when they expire.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated X-Change pill behaviour</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Pills are disabled in flashbacks, memories, visions, and dreams where they should not exist.</li>
		<li>Raul remains pillable in the Janet daydream with unique acknowledgement.</li>
		<li>Reversing permanent Choice pills now fully clears permanent effects.</li>
		<li>Transformation pills now clear active genital interactions before changing the body.</li>
		<li>Named-character pill text has been cleaned up.</li>
		<li>Daily pills no longer trigger during soft bad ends.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated body changes</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Gender Identity-driven body changes now progress normally instead of reversing the next day.</li>
		<li>Growth and shrinkage stop at the intended 30%/70% thresholds.</li>
		<li>Fixed clothing dysphoria checks.</li>
		<li>Giant PCs can no longer perform under-table oral on Whitney, Bailey, or Alex.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Stress Max Scaling</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>With the X-Change willpower system enabled, maximum Stress now scales from current willpower points.</li>
		<li>Otherwise it uses the normal old Rebalance calculation.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated school progression</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Subject advancement now requires 50% progress, or 25% after successful cheating.</li>
		<li>Science rank-up messages now correctly describe Tending bonuses.</li>
		<li>School trait descriptions and History grades have been corrected.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated tentacle encounters</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Leg restraints are now identified separately.</li>
		<li>Targeting is clearer, including warnings before mouth-tentacle penetration.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Great Hawk tower</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>A fully upgraded nest bed now matches high-quality bed fatigue recovery for a full harpy partnered with Great Hawk.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated bathing</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Full baths and washes now clean the face, hands, and intimate areas as well as the body.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Kylar stalking</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Successful stalk events now have a five-hour cooldown.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Banish</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Halos grant 1 Banish use and angel wings grant 5.</li>
		<li>Progression forms and chimera variants remain unchanged.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon fixes" aria-hidden="true">&#9874;</span> Fixes and Improvements</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Fixed pronoun and character-reference errors</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Fixed Mother Goose's pronouns, honorifics, and family terms in Bleeding Ward.</li>
		<li>Fixed the islander's pronoun after refusing to play along.</li>
		<li>Fixed pronouns becoming mixed between multiple characters or carrying over between scenes.</li>
		<li>Fixed related NPC dialogue crashes and Water Dragon lab references.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed NNPC and scene-state leaks</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Random NPCs no longer inherit names, dialogue, sex text, or identities from previous named characters.</li>
		<li>Robin and Leighton now use their intended sex-scene text.</li>
		<li>Old positions, conversation targets, and other encounter data are cleared properly when leaving scenes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed temporary-scene stat and body leaks</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Historical events, Hopeless Cycle, and the Janet imagination scene now use their intended temporary body, inventory, outfit, and mechanics.</li>
		<li>Janet's daydream now restores body and virginity changes even after unusual exits.</li>
		<li>Added a missing Drama-scene fallback to prevent a softlock.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed X-Change hairstyles</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Each body now remembers its own hair position and styling.</li>
		<li>Sleeping transformations restore the original hairstyle immediately.</li>
		<li>Clone bodies no longer leak hair-gel state.</li>
		<li>Removed duplicate body-restoration code.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed beast and monster-person displays</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Corrected Great Hawk, Black Wolf, and Night Monster gender sprites.</li>
		<li>Fixed the Ivory Wraith and Night Monster Vanilla graphics.</li>
		<li>Dragon Eyes no longer overrides the <strong>always replace beasts</strong> monster-person setting.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed bullet vibe behaviour</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Corrected missing remotes, blank power states, pass-out theft messages, library power reduction, and consensual library endings.</li>
		<li>Remote ownership messages now correctly describe who has it and whether the vibrator can still be removed.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed encounter endings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Intentional defeats now apply the correct Stress and Pain changes.</li>
		<li>Normal endings no longer count as giving up.</li>
		<li>Fixed related encounter loops and punishment handling.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Mate for Life</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The buff now triggers correctly when sleeping with Avery or Poppy.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed parasite systems</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Parasite births now correctly unlock notebook discoveries and Harper's advice.</li>
		<li>Existing saves rebuild discoveries from parasites still in tanks.</li>
		<li>Parasite pregnancy no longer counts as a normal pregnancy or applies full pregnancy penalties.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed popup doll sprites</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Popup sprites now use clean whole-number scaling and improved positioning.</li>
		<li>Body and lighting layers remain aligned, including under browser zoom.</li>
		<li>Sidebar sprites are unchanged.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Updated UI switching and performance</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Sidebar and menu backgrounds are no longer unnecessarily redrawn every passage.</li>
		<li>Switching between Updated and Plain UI no longer reloads the current passage or alters gameplay state.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed school pool party</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>The guard now displays the inflation-adjusted price.</li>
		<li>Fully naked swimming now counts for the relevant blackmail task.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed Equine Rescue</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Missing farmhands are restored automatically so the Livestock Field Gang encounter no longer produces missing-NPC errors.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed NPC strap-on descriptions</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Removed duplicated wording such as “strap-on strap-on.”</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed sidebar clothing warnings</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Missing lower-body coverage now clearly tells the player to equip suitable clothing before normal public interactions become available.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Fixed assorted gameplay issues</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>GooseFem body and head.</li>
		<li>Anal straddling.</li>
		<li>Kaiju flyer job.</li>
		<li>Wardrobe errors when loading saves.</li>
		<li>Bike <strong>Get off your bike</strong>.</li>
		<li>Pillory photo crash.</li>
		<li>Missing health multipliers in affected encounters.</li>
		<li>Bontique incorrectly always closing.</li>
		<li>Temple vigil washing.</li>
		<li>Golden necklace and asylum/Avery mansion wardrobe issues.</li>
		<li>Various typo and audit fixes.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
		<h2><span class="dolx-changelog-section-icon images" aria-hidden="true">&#10024;</span> Art and Graphics</h2>
		<ul>
		<li><strong>Added art by Sam Storiez</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>GooseFem Elegant Gown Short.</li>
		<li>GooseFem Demon Chimera variants for cat and wolf.</li>
		<li>Vanilla Melusine full default set.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated fox graphics</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Restored the original fox graphic as the default.</li>
		<li>The newer graphic is now used for floppy ears and fluffy tail variants.</li>
		<li>Added a GooseFem variant by Froggy.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		<li><strong>Updated Mikili</strong>
		<ul>
		<li>Updates by Klootzak, corb_29, 酒肆, Yuyuyu, and 柠檬炖咸鱼.</li>
		</ul>
		</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
<</widget>>
